{"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/SwiftLibgit2\/documentation\/SwiftLibgit2"]]},"metadata":{"externalID":"s:12SwiftLibgit212GitDiffDeltaV","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"GitDiffDelta"}],"title":"GitDiffDelta","roleHeading":"Structure","modules":[{"name":"swift-libgit2"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"GitDiffDelta"}],"symbolKind":"struct","role":"symbol"},"kind":"symbol","variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/swiftlibgit2\/gitdiffdelta"]}],"relationshipsSections":[{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/SwiftLibgit2\/s8SendableP","doc:\/\/SwiftLibgit2\/s16SendableMetatypeP"],"type":"conformsTo","kind":"relationships","title":"Conforms To"}],"topicSections":[{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/SwiftLibgit2\/documentation\/SwiftLibgit2\/GitDiffDelta\/flags","doc:\/\/SwiftLibgit2\/documentation\/SwiftLibgit2\/GitDiffDelta\/nFiles","doc:\/\/SwiftLibgit2\/documentation\/SwiftLibgit2\/GitDiffDelta\/newFile","doc:\/\/SwiftLibgit2\/documentation\/SwiftLibgit2\/GitDiffDelta\/oldFile","doc:\/\/SwiftLibgit2\/documentation\/SwiftLibgit2\/GitDiffDelta\/similarity","doc:\/\/SwiftLibgit2\/documentation\/SwiftLibgit2\/GitDiffDelta\/status"],"generated":true,"title":"Instance Properties","anchor":"Instance-Properties"}],"seeAlsoSections":[{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/SwiftLibgit2\/documentation\/SwiftLibgit2\/GitDiffFile","doc:\/\/SwiftLibgit2\/documentation\/SwiftLibgit2\/GitDiffOptions","doc:\/\/SwiftLibgit2\/documentation\/SwiftLibgit2\/GitDiffBinaryFile","doc:\/\/SwiftLibgit2\/documentation\/SwiftLibgit2\/GitDiffBinary","doc:\/\/SwiftLibgit2\/documentation\/SwiftLibgit2\/GitDiffHunk","doc:\/\/SwiftLibgit2\/documentation\/SwiftLibgit2\/GitDiffLine","doc:\/\/SwiftLibgit2\/documentation\/SwiftLibgit2\/GitDiffSimilarityMetric","doc:\/\/SwiftLibgit2\/documentation\/SwiftLibgit2\/GitDiffFindOptions","doc:\/\/SwiftLibgit2\/documentation\/SwiftLibgit2\/GitDiffParseOptions","doc:\/\/SwiftLibgit2\/documentation\/SwiftLibgit2\/GitDiffPatchIDOptions"],"generated":true,"title":"Structs","anchor":"Structs"}],"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"minor":3,"patch":0},"abstract":[{"text":"The description of changes to an entry.","type":"text"}],"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/SwiftLibgit2\/documentation\/SwiftLibgit2\/GitDiffDelta"},"sections":[],"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"languages":["swift"],"platforms":["macOS"],"tokens":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"GitDiffDelta","kind":"identifier"}]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"content":[{"level":2,"text":"Overview","type":"heading","anchor":"overview"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A delta is a file pair with old and new versions. The old version may be"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"absent if the file was just created and the new version may be absent if"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the file was deleted. A diff is mostly just a list of deltas."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"When iterating over a diff, this will be passed to most callbacks and the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"file contents may be used to understand exactly what has changed."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiftLibgit2\/documentation\/SwiftLibgit2\/GitDiffDelta\/oldFile"},{"type":"text","text":" represents the “from” side of the diff and"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiftLibgit2\/documentation\/SwiftLibgit2\/GitDiffDelta\/newFile"},{"type":"text","text":" represents to “to” side of the diff. What those"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"means depend on the function that was used to generate the diff and is"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"explained below. The "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiftLibgit2\/documentation\/SwiftLibgit2\/GitDiffOptionT\/gitDiffReverse"},{"type":"text","text":" flag may be used"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"to reverse this relationship."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Although the two sides of the delta are named "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiftLibgit2\/documentation\/SwiftLibgit2\/GitDiffDelta\/oldFile"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"and "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiftLibgit2\/documentation\/SwiftLibgit2\/GitDiffDelta\/newFile"},{"type":"text","text":", they actually may correspond to entries that"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"represent a file, a symbolic link, a submodule commit ID, or even a tree"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"(when tracking type changes or ignored or untracked directories)."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Under some circumstances, in the name of efficiency, not all properties"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"will be filled in, but generally as much as possible will be filled in."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"For example, "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiftLibgit2\/documentation\/SwiftLibgit2\/GitDiffDelta\/flags"},{"type":"text","text":" may not have either the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiftLibgit2\/documentation\/SwiftLibgit2\/GitDiffFlagT\/gitDiffFlagBinary"},{"type":"text","text":" or the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiftLibgit2\/documentation\/SwiftLibgit2\/GitDiffFlagT\/gitDiffFlagNotBinary"},{"type":"text","text":" flag set to avoid examining file"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"contents when no hunk and\/or line callbacks are passed in. In this case,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the diff iteration process will use the Git attributes for those files."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiftLibgit2\/documentation\/SwiftLibgit2\/GitDiffDelta\/similarity"},{"type":"text","text":" will be zero unless"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiftLibgit2\/documentation\/SwiftLibgit2\/gitDiffFindSimilar(diff:options:)"},{"type":"text","text":" is called, which performs a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"similarity analysis of files in the diff. That function may be used to"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"perform rename and copy detection, and to split heavily modified files"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"into add\/delete pairs. After that call, deltas with a status of"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiftLibgit2\/documentation\/SwiftLibgit2\/GitDeltaT\/gitDeltaRenamed"},{"type":"text","text":" or "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiftLibgit2\/documentation\/SwiftLibgit2\/GitDeltaT\/gitDeltaCopied"},{"type":"text","text":" will have"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"a similarity score between 0 and 100 indicating the similarity between"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the old version and the new version."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"If "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiftLibgit2\/documentation\/SwiftLibgit2\/gitDiffFindSimilar(diff:options:)"},{"type":"text","text":" is used to find heavily modified"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"files to break, but not to actually break the records, then"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiftLibgit2\/documentation\/SwiftLibgit2\/GitDeltaT\/gitDeltaModified"},{"type":"text","text":" records may have a non-zero similarity score"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"if the self-similarity is below the split threshold. To display this value"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"like core Git, invert the score by subtracting it from 100."}]},{"level":2,"text":"C Equivalent","type":"heading","anchor":"C-Equivalent"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"https:\/\/libgit2.org\/docs\/reference\/main\/diff\/git_diff_delta.html"}]}],"kind":"content"}],"references":{"doc://SwiftLibgit2/documentation/SwiftLibgit2/GitDiffBinaryFile":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiftLibgit2\/documentation\/SwiftLibgit2\/GitDiffBinaryFile","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"GitDiffBinaryFile","kind":"identifier"}],"fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"GitDiffBinaryFile","kind":"identifier"}],"url":"\/documentation\/swiftlibgit2\/gitdiffbinaryfile","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The contents of one of the files in a binary diff."}],"kind":"symbol","role":"symbol","type":"topic","title":"GitDiffBinaryFile"},"doc://SwiftLibgit2/documentation/SwiftLibgit2/GitDiffFile":{"title":"GitDiffFile","identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiftLibgit2\/documentation\/SwiftLibgit2\/GitDiffFile","url":"\/documentation\/swiftlibgit2\/gitdifffile","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"GitDiffFile","kind":"identifier"}],"type":"topic","kind":"symbol","role":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"GitDiffFile","kind":"identifier"}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The description of one side of a diff delta."}]},"doc://SwiftLibgit2/documentation/SwiftLibgit2/GitDeltaT/gitDeltaRenamed":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiftLibgit2\/documentation\/SwiftLibgit2\/GitDeltaT\/gitDeltaRenamed","fragments":[{"text":"case","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"gitDeltaRenamed","kind":"identifier"}],"url":"\/documenta